{"id":"umher","lemma":"umher","pos":"adv","rank":4601,"glosses":["around, round, about"],"ipa":"/ʊmˈheːɐ̯/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/ce/De-umher.ogg/De-umher.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Sie liefen umher.","en":"They walked around.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/745256","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to walk","l":"laufen"},null]},{"text":"Im Garten lief ein Hund umher.","en":"A dog ran around in the garden.","words":[{"g":"in the"},{"g":"garden, yard"},{"g":"to walk","l":"laufen"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"dog, hound"},null]},{"text":"Ich lief ziellos umher.","en":"I walked around aimlessly.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to walk","l":"laufen"},{"g":"aimless"},null]},{"text":"Ich ziehe umher wie ein Nomade.","en":"I roam around like a nomad.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to pull","l":"ziehen"},null,{"g":"how"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"nomad"}]},{"text":"Auf dem Dach spaziert eine Katze umher.","en":"A cat is walking on the roof.","words":[{"g":"on"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"roof"},{"g":"to take a walk","l":"spazieren"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"house cat"},null]}]}